<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Whether the day is a weekday, weekend, or holiday, the quoted price remains fixed.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The company will not add extra charges for late pickups, extended loading times, or special handling.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This guarantees that the estimate you receive on the contract is the exact amount you will pay.</span></li></ul>

<p>To reinforce transparency, reputable firms provide <strong>itemized written contracts</strong> that break down every line item: packing materials, labor hours, transport mileage, and any optional services. Each item is clearly labeled with its cost, so you can see exactly what you are paying for.</p>
<p>In addition, the contract will include <strong>IBA‑approved bills of lading</strong> for government or corporate clients. These documents are officially recognized by the Indian Bureau of Accounts, simplifying claims and reimbursements for business relocations.</p>

<p>Finally, peace of mind is guaranteed with <strong>100 % declared‑value transit insurance</strong>. The company will insure all goods at their full declared value, covering loss or damage during the move. The insurance is automatically included in the contract and does not incur an extra premium, ensuring that your belongings are protected without additional cost.</p>

